      data:
        m_KeyId: 2572462735360
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The name in the map file's header. Save Merged keeps it when it keeps the checksum, and otherwise (as Save Level does) names it after the saved file. Marathon doesn't show it.
    - rid: 552786097007231198
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
